an>密码如钥匙，绝不外借！请勿向任何人透露</p></div></div></div><h3 id=\"h6f20189-impC4iST\" data-id=\"h6f20189-impC4iST\">方式二：开发者授权</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-tHDeVNOy\">已注册成为开发者，并且有申请过用户授权，可直接使用API接口的AccessToken</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%5C%22mcpServers%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8F%E5%8D%83%E5%B7%9D%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22url%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Fqianchuan%2Fmcp%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22headers%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22%7BAccess-Token%7D%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Content-Type%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22application%2Fjson%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22disabled%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22JSv8l%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content json\"></div></div></div></div><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-8PLbbqdE\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-qm1OZHEk\">工具列表</h2><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-jWhlXcEi\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-63kPf0De\">MCP 默认的工具列表见【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/mcp?app_id=1837698859935771\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">MCP鉴权</a>】页面</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hP6OkLTQ\">支持工具能力介绍可参考【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1847297003631945?origin=left_nav\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">千川MCP工具列表</a>】,可通过添加heder “Tool-Range”拉取自定义tools，例如</li></ol><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%5C%22mcpServers%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8F%E5%8D%83%E5%B7%9D%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22url%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Fqianchuan%2Fmcp%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22headers%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22%7BAccess-Token%7D%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Content-Type%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22application%2Fjson%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Tool-Range%5C%22%3A%5C%22%5B%5C%5C%5C%22advertiser_info_v2%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%5C%5C%5C%22advertiser_public_info_v2%5C%5C%5C%22%5D%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22disabled%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22UPsMi%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content json\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-QHoOR9Lz\"><br></p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-Fqgtr1xb\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-TNVNCcf5\">示例场景</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-DnaWRcWy\">在支持的客户端配置以上MCP Server后，你可能尝试询问LLM模型的事情：</p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SuLQ5%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-Mvf34P7S%5C%22%3E%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%E4%BB%A5%E3%80%90%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faily.feishu.cn%2Fhc%2F1u7kleqg%2F3d5z9ttt%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8B%E9%A3%9E%E4%B9%A6Aily%E2%80%8B%3C%2F